{"id":"dac0596ff0a0af4a","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-galois-group.md","title":"Galois Group","display":"df-galois-group — Galois Group","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-galois-group","aliases":["58-df-galois-group","Galois Group"],"display":"df-galois-group — Galois Group","depends_on":["[[58-df-field-extension]]","[[58-df-automorphism]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-galois-group"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-galois-group</span><span>Galois Group</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-galois-group — Galois Group"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"699918fd54cc2a8e\" href=\"?note=699918fd54cc2a8e\" title=\"58-df-field-extension\">58-df-field-extension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1eb2bd3bd0214732\" href=\"?note=1eb2bd3bd0214732\" title=\"58-df-automorphism\">58-df-automorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,K,\\sigma_K,G\\in V\">\\(F,K,\\sigma_K,G\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FieldExtension}_S(K,F)\">\\(\\mathrm{FieldExtension}_S(K,F)\\)</span> (field extension, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"699918fd54cc2a8e\" href=\"?note=699918fd54cc2a8e\" title=\"58-df-field-extension\">58-df-field-extension</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Aut}_S(f,K,\\sigma_K)\">\\(\\mathrm{Aut}_S(f,K,\\sigma_K)\\)</span> (automorphism predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1eb2bd3bd0214732\" href=\"?note=1eb2bd3bd0214732\" title=\"58-df-automorphism\">58-df-automorphism</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GaloisGroup}_S(G;K,F,\\sigma_K)\">\\(\\mathrm{GaloisGroup}_S(G;K,F,\\sigma_K)\\)</span> (Galois-group carrier relation defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}galois\\text{-}group} \\vdash \\mathrm{GaloisGroup}_S(G;K,F,\\sigma_K)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{FieldExtension}_S(K,F)\\land G=\\{f\\in\\mathcal P(K\\times K):\\mathrm{Function}(f,K,K)\\land\\mathrm{Aut}_S(f,K,\\sigma_K)\\land\\forall x\\in F\\;(f(x)=x)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}galois\\text{-}group} \\vdash \\mathrm{GaloisGroup}_S(G;K,F,\\sigma_K)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{FieldExtension}_S(K,F)\\land G=\\{f\\in\\mathcal P(K\\times K):\\mathrm{Function}(f,K,K)\\land\\mathrm{Aut}_S(f,K,\\sigma_K)\\land\\forall x\\in F\\;(f(x)=x)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Galois: normal + separable field extension</li>\n<li>The automorphism set is an explicit output <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> and its members are set-coded function graphs.</li>\n<li>Fundamental theorem: subfields <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leftrightarrow\">\\(\\leftrightarrow\\)</span> subgroups</li>\n<li>Fixed field: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K^{G&#39;} = \\{x \\in K : \\sigma(x) = x \\;\\forall \\sigma \\in G&#39;\\}\">\\(K^{G&#39;} = \\{x \\in K : \\sigma(x) = x \\;\\forall \\sigma \\in G&#39;\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li>Examples: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Gal}(\\mathbb{Q}(\\zeta_n)/\\mathbb{Q}) \\cong (\\mathbb{Z}/n\\mathbb{Z})^\\times\">\\(\\mathrm{Gal}(\\mathbb{Q}(\\zeta_n)/\\mathbb{Q}) \\cong (\\mathbb{Z}/n\\mathbb{Z})^\\times\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Lang, Algebra</li>\n<li>Dummit and Foote, Abstract Algebra</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-field-extension","status":"resolved","id":"699918fd54cc2a8e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-field-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-automorphism","status":"resolved","id":"1eb2bd3bd0214732","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-automorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-field-extension","status":"resolved","id":"699918fd54cc2a8e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FieldExtension}_S(K,F)$ (field extension, see [[58-df-field-extension]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-automorphism","status":"resolved","id":"1eb2bd3bd0214732","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Aut}_S(f,K,\\sigma_K)$ (automorphism predicate, see [[58-df-automorphism]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F,K,\\sigma_K,G\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FieldExtension}_S(K,F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Aut}_S(f,K,\\sigma_K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GaloisGroup}_S(G;K,F,\\sigma_K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}galois\\text{-}group} \\vdash \\mathrm{GaloisGroup}_S(G;K,F,\\sigma_K)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{FieldExtension}_S(K,F)\\land G=\\{f\\in\\mathcal P(K\\times K):\\mathrm{Function}(f,K,K)\\land\\mathrm{Aut}_S(f,K,\\sigma_K)\\land\\forall x\\in F\\;(f(x)=x)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\leftrightarrow","display":false},{"tex":"K^{G'} = \\{x \\in K : \\sigma(x) = x \\;\\forall \\sigma \\in G'\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Gal}(\\mathbb{Q}(\\zeta_n)/\\mathbb{Q}) \\cong (\\mathbb{Z}/n\\mathbb{Z})^\\times","display":false}],"bytes":1348,"backlinks":[{"id":"80c210450e512314","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GaloisGroup}_S$ (Galois-group carrier relation; see [[../batch20/58-df-galois-group.md]])"},{"id":"ee0e6fd2a5876cee","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Gal}_{\\sigma}(L/K)$ is the Galois-group construction from [[58-df-galois-group]]"},{"id":"9197104486eef137","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Gal}_{\\sigma_K}(K/k)$ (Galois group, see [[58-df-galois-group]])"},{"id":"5609e5894b943af5","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-134","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-galois-group]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-569","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-galois-group.md|58-df-galois-group]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["699918fd54cc2a8e","1eb2bd3bd0214732","36d7463d215be751"]}